Dotfiles for various things, managed with GNU Stow (one package per directory).

    git clone --recurse-submodules <repo> ~/.dotfiles
    cd ~/.dotfiles
    make install      # stows the core packages
    make bootstrap    # Firefox links and VS Code settings (copied, not linked)

Optional packages: make install PACKAGES="bash fish git vim hive mysql psql"
Remove everything: make uninstall

Machine-specific settings go in untracked files in $HOME:
    ~/.config/bash/custom
    ~/.config/fish/conf.d/local.fish
    ~/.vimrc.local
    ~/.gitconfig.local
